Subject: [Roxygen-devel] usage section in .Rd files - line breaks
Message-ID: <1155B67E-77B1-4B74-B0F4-B6B40593AA30@gmx.de>

Hi all,

whenever a function has many arguments, the usage lines in the PDF reference manual will exceed the page (using roxygen).
The line breaks in the .Rd file are as far as can tell always the same as in the PDF reference. 
The number characters roxygen puts in each line of the .Rd usage section before setting a line break is too long, I think.
Is there a way to cope with that? (of course @usage... but I mean an automatic one ...) Do I oversee something?
If not, it would be nice to change that, so the usage section does not exceed the given space anymore.

Mark

